{"type": "say", "text": "Hello everyone. I'm calling this structured case review to order. As you know, Avery has raised a concern regarding Morgan's communication during recent team discussions, and it's been impacting collaboration. This hasn't yet resulted in any formal discipline, but I need to determine the appropriate response and record an improvement plan.

Before I finalize anything, the case-review protocol requires each of you — Morgan, Avery, and Lee — to provide your factual account of what happened and identify any support or follow-up you believe is needed. Please place your account and requested follow-up into the case record using the formal record-entry action. I'll be relying on those on-the-record entries as I settle on next steps.

Let's begin with Avery's account first, then Morgan, then Lee. Avery, whenever you're ready, please go ahead."}

